# Chang'e, Moon Palace Immortal

> Chang'e is a siege mage who converts mana into map pressure. Her rabbit companion grants a permanent shield, enhanced basics that chew through towers, and a Meteor Shower ultimate that turns jungle corridors into no-go zones. She is not a burst mage: she is sustained-fire artillery that forces the enemy to choose between defending a split push and contesting an objective.

