## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-12. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Siege Default (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Blood Wings, Divine Glaive, Enchanted Talisman
- Core: Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Swift, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use when the enemy mid and roamer cannot punish you early and flat Magic Penetration matters more than cooldown tempo.; Glowing Wand over Enchanted Talisman when Use when the enemy relies on healing, shields, or HP-stacking frontliners and your mana discipline is stable.; Winter Crown over Enchanted Talisman when Use when one dive combo can break Crescent Moon and kill you before Meteor Shower finishes.; Ice Queen Wand over Blood Wings when Use when your team needs repeated slows to keep fighters inside Meteor Shower rather than extra shield value.
- Total cost: 11850 gold

Default mid build for ranked games where Chang'e wants early Genius Wand shred, Holy Crystal damage, and enough late mana to keep sieging.

### Split-Push Attack Speed (Mid)

- Items: Swift Boots, Feather of Heaven, Golden Staff, Holy Crystal, Blood Wings, Divine Glaive
- Core: Feather of Heaven, Golden Staff, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Weakness Finder
- Battle spell: Sprint
- Flex: Genius Wand over Golden Staff when Use when you still need teamfight Meteor Shower damage and cannot afford to commit fully to turret racing.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when assassins are reaching you before Sprint creates enough space.; Immortality over Blood Wings when Use in late Lord trades where one failed side-lane escape would end the game.; Glowing Wand over Divine Glaive when Use when the enemy has low Magic Defense but strong healing or shielding that your team has not answered.
- Total cost: 11810 gold

Side-pressure setup that turns Crescent Moon's enhanced basic attacks into turret damage while keeping enough Magic Power for objective cleanup.

### Anti-Dive Control (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Genius Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Winter Crown, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Genius Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Winter Crown
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Holy Crystal over Winter Crown when Use when your front line is protecting you and damage, not survival, is the reason fights are stalling.; Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy dive is damage-heavy but not control-heavy enough to justify Fortitude.; Glowing Wand over Blood Wings when Use when sustain heroes are walking through your slows and the team lacks anti-heal.; Immortality over Blood Wings when Use in late base defense when surviving one pick attempt matters more than extra Magic Power.
- Total cost: 10720 gold

Defensive mid setup for hard-engage drafts where Chang'e must keep Crescent Moon active, slow divers, and survive the first lockout.

